    {
      "datasource": {"type": "datasource", "uid": "-- Mixed --"},
      "description": "Collector freshness, the latest explicit synthetic transport probe, and authentic completed-response telemetry. Run task telemetry:doctor to refresh the transport probe. Idle is healthy and does not mean ingestion failed.",
